   "cooked": "<p><strong>Hatch Exchange Rate</strong></p>\n<p>The Hatch Exchange Rate determines the number of TE Commons Hatch Tokens that are sent to the Hatchers per DAI that is sent.</p>\n<p>For example, in the test Hatch that is happening now at <a href=\"https://hatch.tecommons.org\">hatch.tecommons.org</a>, the Hatch Exchange Rate is set to 0.00000001 and 1 wxDAI creates 10,000 TESTTEC.</p>\n<p>In the end, this parameter is relatively irrelevant to the economics of the system and has more of a psychological effect.</p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "wayback",
    "timestamp": "20230204025426",
